WEBVTT

00:01:45.350 --> 00:01:46.610
Shuddup... Shut up!

00:01:46.920 --> 00:01:50.120
I have to get going.
Wake up already, Kyo!

00:01:50.260 --> 00:01:51.050
'Kay...

00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:04.000
248, 249, 250...

00:02:23.790 --> 00:02:25.660
At last, the day of rebirth is here! YEAH!

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:28.160
Oh, man, I'm late! I'm late!

00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:32.600
I have to get going.
Wake up already, Koji!

00:02:36.470 --> 00:02:38.870
'Morning...

00:02:38.870 --> 00:02:41.310
Koji, hurry up and get dressed!

00:02:41.310 --> 00:02:43.110
You do this every single day!

00:02:43.110 --> 00:02:45.140
I've still got plenty of time.

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:47.010
You're the one who's in trouble!

00:02:47.010 --> 00:02:49.110
I was up late doing post-production!

00:02:50.380 --> 00:02:52.440
Hey! Don't watch TV!

00:03:01.230 --> 00:03:02.100
A fine meal.

00:03:05.570 --> 00:03:08.400
Oh... This is all Kyo's fault!

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:14.270
<i>I was led by Shizuno Misaki,</i>
<i>rode in that shining robot...</i>

00:03:14.270 --> 00:03:16.870
<i>And then... That passionate kiss from her...</i>

00:03:20.580 --> 00:03:22.570
Whoops! Edit master! Edit master!

00:03:23.050 --> 00:03:25.020
Kyo would be so angry if I forgot this.

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:31.890
Hm? It's a game.

00:03:31.890 --> 00:03:33.860
But I don't have a game console...

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:35.850
What's this?

00:03:38.560 --> 00:03:39.830
Cerebrum...

00:04:32.920 --> 00:04:37.060
<i>Um... I-I'm Kyo Sogoru,</i>
<i>president of the swim club.</i>

00:04:37.060 --> 00:04:39.390
<i>Your youth is the big bang that starts your life!</i>

00:04:39.390 --> 00:04:42.260
<i>These days of flaming passion</i>
<i>will never come again!</i>

00:04:42.260 --> 00:04:44.660
<i>Don't you want to try to swim</i>
<i>to the ends of the cosmos?!</i>

00:04:44.660 --> 00:04:47.160
<i>Come with me! And together, let's swim!</i>

00:04:49.770 --> 00:04:52.340
So, everyone who wants to sign up,
just write your name and class...

00:04:52.340 --> 00:04:53.410
on the form on your desks...

00:04:53.410 --> 00:04:55.840
What's with that ending? Lame!

00:04:55.840 --> 00:05:00.310
Still, if I can shoot stuff like that,
I wouldn't mind joining the video club.

00:05:00.310 --> 00:05:02.880
Um, it's the swim club, not the video club.

00:05:02.880 --> 00:05:04.580
Hello-o-o!

00:05:04.580 --> 00:05:07.020
Wha... Hey, wait a sec! Hey!

00:05:10.860 --> 00:05:14.530
If you agree to do P.R. videos
like that for all the other clubs,

00:05:14.530 --> 00:05:17.930
we could think about budgeting
a video club for next term.

00:05:18.400 --> 00:05:19.930
Thank you so much!

00:05:19.930 --> 00:05:22.800
Hey! Kaminagi, you cut a secret
deal with them, didn't you?!

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:26.840
Of course! Why else do you
think I'd do this for free?

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:29.140
You need four people
by the end of the term.

00:05:29.140 --> 00:05:31.080
If you can't get that many,
your club will be shut down.

00:05:31.080 --> 00:05:34.710
And hearing that,
I wish you the best of luck, Sogoru!

00:05:35.110 --> 00:05:38.380
Kurage! Dammit, act like
an advisor and object to this!

00:05:39.350 --> 00:05:41.820
Everything Miss Minato said is correct.

00:05:42.690 --> 00:05:46.720
Wait just a damned minute, Mr. President!
You want me to spill the beans?!

00:05:47.260 --> 00:05:48.930
"Spill the beans?"

00:05:48.930 --> 00:05:51.060
I didn't want to do it this way,

00:05:51.060 --> 00:05:54.330
but this is more important
than anything else.

00:05:55.570 --> 00:05:57.500
Oh, that? That doesn't matter.

00:05:57.940 --> 00:05:59.910
We don't mind at all.

00:06:01.440 --> 00:06:06.000
However, I expect you to keep
your word to Yehl, Kyo Sogoru.

00:06:11.880 --> 00:06:16.220
Dammit! Okay, you asked for it!
Everyone, look at this!

00:06:19.790 --> 00:06:21.660
It's Pain of Zega, right?

00:06:21.660 --> 00:06:22.990
What about it?

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:25.390
Huh? You know about it?

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:28.100
Will you fight?

00:06:28.100 --> 00:06:31.930
Even when the world suddenly
crumbles before your eyes?

00:06:32.510 --> 00:06:36.240
The mysterious life forms known as
the Gards-orm suddenly attacked.

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:39.640
Due to their environmental modification
testing, the world has been changed.

00:06:40.310 --> 00:06:44.610
The remaining humans have formed
a resistance group: Cerebrum.

00:06:45.350 --> 00:06:49.190
This is the true story of what
happened 40 years later.

00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:52.920
Welcome, to the future of the world.

00:06:53.690 --> 00:06:55.130
The future of the world...

00:06:55.130 --> 00:06:57.860
It's a famous game. Everyone plays it.

00:06:58.400 --> 00:07:00.260
Hm? How do I work it?

00:07:01.300 --> 00:07:05.530
If you register your I.D. and password,
you can join the on-line battles.

00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:08.640
Around here, you can log in
via the Maihama server.

00:07:08.640 --> 00:07:10.700
Maihama server, huh? Okay!

00:07:10.810 --> 00:07:16.150
Sogoru Kyo... Password...
Blah-blah-blah-BLAH!

00:07:21.390 --> 00:07:24.790
What? Sogoru, you've already got
an account on here.

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:27.520
Huh? No way.
It's not like I've ever played.

00:07:30.530 --> 00:07:31.960
Good shot!

00:07:38.440 --> 00:07:40.470
Deutera zone has enlarged greatly.

00:07:40.470 --> 00:07:44.000
Its diameter is currently 1800 meters.

00:07:45.380 --> 00:07:46.910
What do you think, Lu-shen?

00:07:46.910 --> 00:07:50.920
We'll need Zegapain's
cooperation in there all the more.

00:07:50.920 --> 00:07:52.690
We're against it!

00:07:52.690 --> 00:07:55.950
Last time, he was
totally reckless in battle!

00:07:56.490 --> 00:07:58.680
He'll just make things
harder for us and Lu-shen!

00:07:59.690 --> 00:08:03.690
The enemy constructed a deutera
zone there before, as well.

00:08:04.200 --> 00:08:06.830
We fought in there once before.

00:08:06.830 --> 00:08:11.070
Are you trying to say that fighting in
the same place will jog his memory...

00:08:11.070 --> 00:08:13.970
and he'll be able to
cooperate as well as before?

00:08:14.670 --> 00:08:19.130
I think the commander has
already taken that into account.

00:08:20.950 --> 00:08:24.020
If I was counting on
such an uncertain element,

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:26.920
I wouldn't order you out
on the mission, Yehl.

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:28.380
However...

00:08:29.390 --> 00:08:32.480
We can't just ignore that thing any longer.

00:08:35.800 --> 00:08:39.100
What's this?
Not practicing today, either?

00:08:39.100 --> 00:08:40.800
The club's doomed for sure.

00:08:40.800 --> 00:08:43.300
He's probably too ashamed to show up.

00:08:43.300 --> 00:08:47.830
After all the fuss he made about that P.R.
video, he didn't get one person to sign up.

00:08:47.940 --> 00:08:50.110
It's always the same story with him.

00:08:50.110 --> 00:08:52.630
He charges in alone and
just wastes the entire effort.

00:08:53.680 --> 00:08:55.480
What's with you?!

00:08:55.480 --> 00:08:56.740
Nothing.

00:09:03.920 --> 00:09:05.020
Kawaguchi!

00:09:07.660 --> 00:09:09.750
Do it, Kyo!

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:15.900
We were the only ones
who worked together as a team.

00:09:17.070 --> 00:09:18.400
Let's go!

00:09:18.400 --> 00:09:19.770
Right...

00:09:28.580 --> 00:09:31.950
Yeah! Gotcha! You like that?

00:09:32.220 --> 00:09:34.150
Okay, who's next?

00:09:36.190 --> 00:09:37.090
What's that?

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:38.820
Kyo! Don't get distracted!

00:09:42.530 --> 00:09:43.790
Game over.

00:09:44.430 --> 00:09:47.730
Aw, and you'd finally found
the deutera zone, too.

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:49.340
Deutera zone?

00:09:49.340 --> 00:09:52.910
The environmental testing zones
the Gards-orm create.

00:09:52.910 --> 00:09:54.570
They explain that in the intro!

00:09:54.570 --> 00:09:56.010
Do they?

00:09:56.010 --> 00:09:59.940
If they cover the Earth with them,
mankind loses.

00:10:00.580 --> 00:10:06.420
Still, you did really well finding the
deutera zone on your first time out, Kyo!

00:10:08.350 --> 00:10:12.090
<i>Now that I think about it, they never</i>
<i>told me why I was fighting for them.</i>

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:16.830
<i>Why haven't I thought</i>
<i>to question it until now?</i>

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:21.130
<i>Why am I suddenly so good at all this?</i>

00:10:29.540 --> 00:10:32.280
What do you think my parents
would say if we did it?

00:10:32.280 --> 00:10:34.350
They'd be all "We're not
letting <i>our</i> daughter...

00:10:34.350 --> 00:10:36.350
go haunting around
the bad parts of Shibuya!"

00:10:36.350 --> 00:10:39.320
And then they'd ask what year I think it is
and if I was part of a gang or something!

00:10:39.590 --> 00:10:42.650
You have good parents.
Mine let me do practically anything.

00:10:42.820 --> 00:10:45.690
Oh well, we'll catch a concert
some other time, then.

00:10:45.690 --> 00:10:48.560
I'm really sorry,
but I promise I'll come next time!

00:10:48.560 --> 00:10:51.260
Oh, there's Misaki-sempai.

00:10:51.660 --> 00:10:53.150
Misaki-sempai!

00:10:58.400 --> 00:11:02.340
Hi there. And thank you for
doing the swim club video!

00:11:03.210 --> 00:11:05.970
I should thank you for
making me look so good in it.

00:11:06.410 --> 00:11:11.150
So tell us, is it true that
you kissed Kyo Sogoru?!

00:11:11.150 --> 00:11:14.050
Mizuki, that's rude!
Just asking about that!

00:11:14.050 --> 00:11:16.220
There's no way it happened, right?

00:11:16.220 --> 00:11:18.350
You and him just don't go together!

00:11:18.620 --> 00:11:19.720
It felt good.

00:11:20.730 --> 00:11:24.330
I enjoyed being filmed.
The way you captured me.

00:11:24.330 --> 00:11:25.990
Oh. Sure...

00:11:26.600 --> 00:11:28.500
You like making movies?

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:29.570
Yes!

00:11:29.570 --> 00:11:33.470
This girl's dream is to
become a director one day.

00:11:33.470 --> 00:11:36.640
Oh, Mizuki, you don't
have to tell her all that!

00:11:37.740 --> 00:11:39.280
Your dream...

00:11:39.280 --> 00:11:41.970
You'll be going on to university, right?

00:11:43.080 --> 00:11:45.520
You're a senior, right?

00:11:45.520 --> 00:11:47.610
You mean, what's in my future?

00:11:53.490 --> 00:11:55.260
Well, we'd better get going.

00:11:55.260 --> 00:11:56.460
See you.

00:11:56.460 --> 00:11:57.790
Goodbye.

00:12:00.230 --> 00:12:03.330
The world is simply "here" and "now."

00:12:14.180 --> 00:12:15.580
Oh, yeah!

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:18.280
Mission clear. Return to ship at once.

00:12:19.590 --> 00:12:21.220
Look, there's something there!

00:12:21.220 --> 00:12:23.090
Huh? What do you mean?

00:12:23.160 --> 00:12:25.090
It's an I.D. -specific hidden item.

00:12:25.420 --> 00:12:26.660
What's that?

00:12:26.660 --> 00:12:31.030
Someone left a message that only
shows up under your I.D., Kyo.

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:32.060
From who?

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:34.500
I dunno. You're fighting on-line.

00:12:44.810 --> 00:12:45.870
I'm home.

00:12:47.250 --> 00:12:48.850
Oh, Kyo. You're here.

00:12:48.850 --> 00:12:51.280
He doesn't have a game console,
so he asked if he could use ours.

00:12:51.480 --> 00:12:53.310
He's really good, too!

00:12:53.920 --> 00:12:54.790
Kyo?

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:57.320
Huh? O- Oh...

00:12:57.320 --> 00:12:59.790
It's nothing.

00:13:08.570 --> 00:13:10.400
I'm already involved with her.

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:15.740
Right up to my neck...

00:13:15.740 --> 00:13:16.680
Huh?

00:13:16.680 --> 00:13:18.580
Koji, I'd like to play more some other time.

00:13:18.580 --> 00:13:19.550
Sure thing!

00:13:19.550 --> 00:13:21.080
See you, Kaminagi.

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:22.840
Huh? Wait! Hold it!

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:30.520
<i>Cerebrants and deuteras...</i>

00:13:30.520 --> 00:13:32.760
<i>The Gards-orm and all that other stuff.</i>

00:13:32.760 --> 00:13:35.280
<i>And that message to not get</i>
<i>involved with Shizuno Misaki.</i>

00:13:35.460 --> 00:13:38.920
<i>So much is happening so fast,</i>
<i>my head feels like it's going to explode!</i>

00:13:44.170 --> 00:13:47.040
Since you managed
to clear a level for now,

00:13:47.040 --> 00:13:49.200
I want you to go with me,
despite my misgivings.

00:13:49.610 --> 00:13:51.810
You know everything, don't you?

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:54.580
Do you know about that secret
message I got before, too?

00:13:54.580 --> 00:13:55.650
What do you mean?

00:13:55.650 --> 00:13:59.180
I'm not sure. So, we're going to
that other place again, right?

00:13:59.180 --> 00:13:59.840
Right.

00:14:08.760 --> 00:14:10.420
Why me, though?

00:14:10.860 --> 00:14:15.730
Because you're a Cerebrant.
The same as us.

00:14:15.730 --> 00:14:17.770
A Cerebrant, huh?

00:14:17.770 --> 00:14:19.800
Whatever.

00:14:21.910 --> 00:14:23.710
Come on in, Shizuno-sempai!

00:14:23.710 --> 00:14:26.740
There's no time. I'll indulge you.

00:14:35.390 --> 00:14:37.690
<i>Gunner and Wizard I.D.s, locked in.</i>

00:14:37.690 --> 00:14:39.550
<i>Stand by for meta-body transmission.</i>

00:14:40.290 --> 00:14:42.830
<i>Compensating for materialization probability flux.</i>

00:14:42.830 --> 00:14:43.990
<i>Unstable.</i>

00:14:44.230 --> 00:14:48.630
Teleporting near the edge of a deutera zone
carries a higher risk of transmission failure.

00:14:48.630 --> 00:14:51.100
A deutera zone... Like in the game?

00:14:51.100 --> 00:14:52.570
That's where we're headed.

00:14:52.570 --> 00:14:56.200
Only something with holonic
armor can survive inside there.

00:14:56.610 --> 00:14:58.870
<i>Got it! Transmission scatter rate, green!</i>

00:14:59.610 --> 00:15:01.270
<i>Releasing hangar locks.</i>

00:15:01.780 --> 00:15:03.750
Restoration coordinates, set.

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:04.710
Entangle!

00:15:14.130 --> 00:15:15.760
That's the deutera zone.

00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:16.850
Yeah, I can tell.

00:15:17.700 --> 00:15:20.530
<i>Kyo Sogoru, don't slow us down!</i>

00:15:20.530 --> 00:15:22.530
<i>If you do, we'll abandon you.</i>

00:15:22.530 --> 00:15:24.760
You'll what?! Who the hell are you guys?!

00:15:25.370 --> 00:15:26.410
Let's go!

00:15:26.410 --> 00:15:27.570
Wha?! Why, you!

00:15:35.780 --> 00:15:39.310
Forget them! Try to get as far
inside without wasting our Q.L..

00:15:39.520 --> 00:15:40.110
Roger!

00:15:44.090 --> 00:15:46.890
<i>This isn't deja vu from the game.</i>
<i>I can feel how familiar this is!</i>

00:15:52.870 --> 00:15:54.130
It's all right!

00:16:11.450 --> 00:16:12.820
Incredible...

00:16:14.290 --> 00:16:15.450
What was that?!

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:18.120
Multiple enemies closing from 5 o'clock.

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:21.530
We took a hit on our right leg. Minor damage.

00:16:21.530 --> 00:16:24.860
20 seconds to reconstruction.
Don't return fire, just run!

00:16:37.210 --> 00:16:38.510
You son of a bitch!

00:16:43.680 --> 00:16:45.180
Dammit!

00:16:45.180 --> 00:16:48.320
Bypassing drive line 209 to 273.

00:16:48.320 --> 00:16:50.220
Drive system check... Green!

00:16:50.690 --> 00:16:51.160
Do it!

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:57.090
All right!

00:17:01.970 --> 00:17:03.730
You dumb ass!

00:17:09.110 --> 00:17:09.970
Persistent, aren't they?!

00:17:16.620 --> 00:17:17.310
Lu-shen, above us!

00:17:34.970 --> 00:17:36.030
The Altair?!

00:17:36.640 --> 00:17:39.000
Hey! Are you trying to get us blown up, too?!

00:17:40.840 --> 00:17:42.070
How about thanking me?

00:17:43.680 --> 00:17:45.580
<i>I've got a fix on the core's coordinates.</i>

00:17:45.580 --> 00:17:46.950
<i>Altair, follow me!</i>

00:17:46.950 --> 00:17:47.840
What's with you?!

00:17:58.990 --> 00:18:00.560
Irritating, isn't it?

00:18:00.560 --> 00:18:02.820
Not knowing what's happening in there...

00:18:03.230 --> 00:18:03.990
Quite.

00:18:04.060 --> 00:18:06.720
Even so, we're spending a lot of time watching.

00:18:06.900 --> 00:18:08.730
Kyo Sogoru's sortie.

00:18:08.870 --> 00:18:11.240
Our mission is simple.

00:18:11.240 --> 00:18:14.670
Locate the deutera zones and attack them.

00:18:14.670 --> 00:18:16.370
With one additional duty.

00:18:16.680 --> 00:18:18.910
Salvaging any survivors.

00:18:19.280 --> 00:18:24.810
We have no time to be worrying about the
possible loss of our comrades, Minato.

00:18:42.400 --> 00:18:43.870
He's acting as a shield for us.

00:18:43.870 --> 00:18:45.170
That guy...

00:18:45.170 --> 00:18:46.470
<i>I can't keep this up for long!</i>

00:18:46.470 --> 00:18:48.700
The instant I fall back, shoot the core, Kyo!

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:50.130
Leave it to me!

00:18:56.380 --> 00:18:59.010
Do it, Kyo!

00:19:29.350 --> 00:19:30.620
We did it!

00:19:30.620 --> 00:19:31.950
Good job.

00:19:37.560 --> 00:19:39.020
What are you doing?

00:19:39.460 --> 00:19:40.290
Okay!

00:19:40.290 --> 00:19:41.380
W-Wait a second!

00:19:46.130 --> 00:19:47.930
You come down too, Shizuno-sempai!

00:19:47.930 --> 00:19:50.540
Kyo, stop this! Come back at once!

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:51.300
Kyo!

00:19:55.810 --> 00:19:56.670
This feels familiar...

00:19:59.780 --> 00:20:01.510
Is it possible?

00:20:04.380 --> 00:20:05.850
Don't go over there!

00:20:09.190 --> 00:20:10.050
Uh-oh!

00:20:31.140 --> 00:20:31.770
What?!

00:20:42.550 --> 00:20:43.750
Don't!

00:20:45.460 --> 00:20:46.720
Shizuno-sempai...

00:20:48.460 --> 00:20:50.000
Come back to the Altair.

00:20:50.000 --> 00:20:52.730
All right. But before I do...

00:20:53.900 --> 00:20:54.390
Kyo!

00:21:06.550 --> 00:21:07.880
Impossible...

00:21:09.210 --> 00:21:11.510
Shizuno-sempai... What's going on?

00:22:51.620 --> 00:22:57.380
On the way to recover the Shanghai server,
May-yu spots an enlarging deutera zone.

00:22:57.560 --> 00:23:00.060
If something isn't done,
both the server and Zegatank...

00:23:00.060 --> 00:23:02.650
will be swallowed up by the
deutera zone and destroyed.

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:05.130
Hurry, Kyo Sogoru!

00:23:05.130 --> 00:23:07.770
This battle which you think is a game...

00:23:07.770 --> 00:23:11.400
is for us a battle to save
what can never be replaced!

00:23:12.140 --> 00:23:14.900
Next time, on Zegapain:
"Shanghai Server."

00:23:15.440 --> 00:23:18.310
My thoughts, never to be erased.
